## Deferred-candidates for v2 (recommendation, not obligations)

- OTel tracing (R-O3) — absent today; record explicitly.
- 100-user visibility fuzz + concurrent-region/CrossRegion suites (§23 #21,
  #22) — heavy harness work; explicit deferral beats silent absence.
- Wire-protocol throughput fan-out and additive-change rollout tests
  (§23 #23).
- Identity-derivation proptest over path/offset/timestamp-shaped inputs
  (§23 #29).

## Sign-off

Deterministic baseline: green (all six gate families re-run this round).
Round-1 closure: 14 of 19 items fully closed with tests; W7/H1/H2/H6 carry
residue (H12). New work: 5 invariant violations (B3-B7), 5 wiring gaps
(W9-W13), 2 observability gaps (W14 + OTel deferral), 6 completion items
(H9-H14), 1 process item (P1: commit the round-1 work).
